    retrograde minus prograde = 2.0*V0**2*lambda_c*(s + 1)/R
  [PASS] W2a [HEADLINE] a_R = -lambda_c^2 V^2/R - (u - lambda_c V) lambda_c (V/R)(1 + s): prograde (u = V) and retrograde (u = -V) tracers differ by 2 lambda_c (1 + s) V^2/R; for a flat curve prograde gets -lambda_c V^2/R (inward) and retrograde +lambda_c V^2/R (outward)
